  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed conversion and intensification of use of the property into a five\r\nbedroom/9 person (Sui Generis) House in Multiple Occupation (HMO), by reason of\r\nthe excessive number of occupiers that it accommodates, represents an overly\r\nintensive use of the site which would be likely to give rise to undue levels of\r\ndisturbance and noise resulting in a detrimental impact on the amenities of\r\nfuture occupiers and adjoining properties. Furthermore, the proposal is\r\nunacceptable in principle due to the site’s location in a residential area\r\ntypified by family dwellings. The proposal is therefore contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3.D(7), D3.D(9), and\r\nD3.D(10) and D14 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy HO10 of adopted Harrow Local\r\nPlan (2021-2041).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
